WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:03.837
TODAY MARKS TWO YEARS SINCE THE ATTACK
ON THE SEAT OF AMERICA'S

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:12.678
DEMOCRACY WHEN PRO-TRUMP RIOTERS
STORMED THE CAPITOL OF DONALD

00:00:12.678 --> 00:00:14.848
TRUMP'S 2020 ELECTION LOSS TO
JOE BIDEN.

00:00:14.848 --> 00:00:18.785
NOW THE ESTATE OF BRIAN SICKNICK
IS SUING THE FORMER PRESIDENT.

00:00:18.785 --> 00:00:22.288
HERE WITH THE DETAILS IS PAULA
REED.

00:00:22.288 --> 00:00:25.959
GOOD MORNING TO YOU, WHAT ADO YU
KNOW?

00:00:25.959 --> 00:00:29.028
&gt;&gt; Reporter: GOOD MORNING.
WE'RE GETTING NEWS ABOUT SPECIAL

00:00:29.028 --> 00:00:33.466
COUNSEL JACK SMITH WE'VE LEARNED
HE RECENTLY RETURNED TO THE

00:00:33.466 --> 00:00:37.236
UNITED STATES.
HE HAD BEEN WORKING ABROAD

00:00:37.236 --> 00:00:39.939
FOLLOWING A BIKE ACCIDENT AND
NOW HE'S BACK HE'S STAFFING UP.

00:00:39.939 --> 00:00:44.043
HE'S GOING TO NEED ALL THE HELP
HE CAN GET BECAUSE WE LEARNED HE

00:00:44.043 --> 00:00:47.413
HAS A MOUNTAIN OF NEW EVIDENCE
TO SIFT THROUGH AS HE DECIDES

00:00:47.413 --> 00:00:53.219
WHETHER THE FORMER PRESIDENT AND
HIS ASSOCIATES SHOULD BE CHARGED

00:00:53.219 --> 00:00:57.624
FOR JANUARY 6th.
&gt;&gt; WE CANNOT AFFORD TO BRUSH

00:00:57.624 --> 00:01:00.727
POLITICAL VIOLENCE UNDER THE RUG
OR TURNED A BLIND EYE WHEN

00:01:00.727 --> 00:01:03.162
OTHERS ENCOURAGE IT.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: WHILE PRESIDENT

00:01:03.162 --> 00:01:06.633
BIDEN COMMEMORATES THE SECOND
ANNIVERSARY OF THE JANUARY 6th

00:01:06.633 --> 00:01:13.306
CAPITOL ATTACK BY PRESENTING
MEDALS TO MICHAEL FANONE AND

00:01:13.306 --> 00:01:15.608
OTHER LAW ENFORCEMENT OFFICIALS
WHO RESPONDED THAT DAY, THE

00:01:15.608 --> 00:01:17.911
JUSTICE DEPARTMENT CONTINUES THE
BIGGEST CRIMINAL INVESTIGATION

00:01:17.911 --> 00:01:21.748
IN ITS HISTORY.
ALREADY MORE THAN 950 PEOPLE

00:01:21.748 --> 00:01:25.552
HAVE BEEN ARRESTED FOR THEIR
ALLEGED PARTICIPATION IN THE

00:01:25.552 --> 00:01:31.857
DEADLY RIOT.
ROUGHLY HALF HAVE PLEADED GUILTY

00:01:31.857 --> 00:01:33.226
AND 40 HAVE BEEN CONVICTED AT
TRIAL.

00:01:33.226 --> 00:01:36.462
JUST ONE HAS BEEN ACQUITTED.
THE HOUSE SELECT COMMITTEE THAT

00:01:36.462 --> 00:01:39.699
ALSO INVESTIGATED JANUARY 6th
BELIEVES THAT PROSECUTORS SHOULD

00:01:39.699 --> 00:01:42.569
CHARGE FORMER PRESIDENT TRUMP
AND HIS ASSOCIATES AS WELL.

00:01:42.569 --> 00:01:48.808
&gt;&gt; WE WANT TO MAKE SURE THAT THE
KEY ORGANIZERS AND MOVERS OF

00:01:48.808 --> 00:01:56.349
THIS ATTACK DON'T ESCAPE THE
SCRUTINY OF THE JUSTICE SYSTEM.

00:01:56.349 --> 00:02:00.186
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THAT DECISION IS
NOW UP TO SPECIAL COUNSEL JACK

00:02:00.186 --> 00:02:02.355
SMITH.
APPOINTED TO OVERSEE THE

00:02:02.355 --> 00:02:06.626
INVESTIGATION AND EFFORTS BY
TRUMP AND HIS ALLIES TO OVERTURN

00:02:06.626 --> 00:02:08.394
THE RESULTS OF THE 2020
ELECTION.

00:02:08.394 --> 00:02:11.998
&gt;&gt; BASED ON RECENT DEVELOPMENTS,
INCLUDING THE FORMER PRESIDENT'S

00:02:11.998 --> 00:02:15.201
ANNOUNCEMENT THAT HE IS A
CANDIDATE FOR PRESIDENT IN THE

00:02:15.201 --> 00:02:19.072
NEXT ELECTION AND THE SITTING
PRESIDENT'S STATED INTENTION TO

00:02:19.072 --> 00:02:24.477
BE A CANDIDATE AS WELL, I HAVE
CON INCLUDED THAT IT IS IN THE

00:02:24.477 --> 00:02:28.981
PUBLIC INTEREST TO APPOINT A
SPECIAL COUNSEL.

00:02:28.981 --> 00:02:31.751
&gt;&gt; Reporter: ATTORNEY GENERAL
MERRICK GARLAND PROMISED SMITH'S

00:02:31.751 --> 00:02:32.952
APPOINTMENT WOULDN'T DELAY THE
INVESTIGATION.

00:02:32.952 --> 00:02:35.588
&gt;&gt; HE PROMISED TO THE AMERICAN
PEOPLE IN HIS OWN STATEMENT THAT

00:02:35.588 --> 00:02:38.157
THERE WOULD BE NO PAUSE OR
HICCUP IN HIS WORK.

00:02:38.157 --> 00:02:40.460
&gt;&gt; Reporter: BUT SMITH IS STILL
IN THE PROCESS OF PUTTING

00:02:40.460 --> 00:02:43.596
TOGETHER HIS TEAM.
BRINGING ON TWO LONG-TIME

00:02:43.596 --> 00:02:47.734
ASSOCIATES WHO SPECIALIZE IN
PUBLIC CORRUPTION CASES, A

00:02:47.734 --> 00:02:52.205
SOURCE TELLS CNN.
SMITH ALSO MUST COMB THROUGH A

00:02:52.205 --> 00:02:55.241
MASSIVE AMOUNT OF EVIDENCE,
INCLUDING WHAT THE JANUARY 6th

00:02:55.241 --> 00:02:59.545
COMMITTEE RECENTLY TURNED OVER
AND DISCOVERY COLLECTED FROM

00:02:59.545 --> 00:03:03.449
LAWYERS FROM TRUMP ALLIES LATE
LAST YEAR, SOME OF WHICH HASN'T

00:03:03.449 --> 00:03:07.553
BEEN OPENED YET ACCORDING TO
SOURCES FAMILIAR WITH THE PROBE.

00:03:07.553 --> 00:03:10.956
SMITH HIMSELF FIRED OFF A ROUND
OF SUBPOENAS TO OFFICIALS IN

00:03:10.956 --> 00:03:15.328
SEVEN KEY BATTLEGROUND STATES
AND RECEIVED A TROVE OF

00:03:15.328 --> 00:03:20.400
DOCUMENTS AND THIS VOICE MAIL
FROM SOMEONE CLAIMING TO WORK

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:23.736
FOR TRUMP'S POST ELECTION LEGAL
TEAM.

00:03:23.736 --> 00:03:28.041
&gt;&gt; I'M A LAWYER WITH RUDY
GIULIANI'S TEAM WORKING FOR THE

00:03:28.041 --> 00:03:34.681
PRESIDENT, AND WE NEED ACCESS TO
SOME DOMINION MACHINES WHICH WE

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:38.718
UNDERSTAND MAY BE SOMETHING YOU
CAN HELP US WITH.

00:03:38.718 --> 00:03:40.820
&gt;&gt; REPORTER: FEDERAL PROSECUTORS
HAVE BEEN FOCUSED ON TRUMP'S

00:03:40.820 --> 00:03:43.556
STATE OF MIND AFTER THE 2020
ELECTION BUT IN AN INTERVIEW

00:03:43.556 --> 00:03:48.728
WITH CNN, TRUMP'S LAWYER SAID
THEY ARE NOT WORRIED, AT LEAST

00:03:48.728 --> 00:03:50.430
ABOUT THE EVIDENCE GATHERED BY
THE COMMITTEE.

00:03:50.430 --> 00:03:54.434
&gt;&gt; THEY'VE OUTLINED A FEW
CHARGES HERE, ALL OF WHICH ARE

00:03:54.434 --> 00:03:58.871
COMPLETELY LEGALLY INSUFFICIENT.
SO YEAH, WE KIND OF LOOK AT IT

00:03:58.871 --> 00:04:03.076
AS, IT'S POLITICAL NOISE BUT
DOESN'T HAVE ANY EFFECT AS OF

00:04:03.076 --> 00:04:07.814
RIGHT NOW ON OUR DEFENSE.
&gt;&gt; Reporter: THE JANUARY 6th

00:04:07.814 --> 00:04:13.019
COMMITTEE RAN INTO OBSTACLES
WITH KEY WITNESSES LIKE MARK

00:04:13.019 --> 00:04:15.287
MEADOWS BUT THE JUSTICE
DEPARTMENT HAS ADDITIONAL TOOLS

00:04:15.287 --> 00:04:22.061
LIKE GOING TO COURT TO COMPEL
THE WITNESSES TO COOPERATE.

00:04:22.061 --> 00:04:25.098
BUT THERE IS CONCERN THIS COULD
GO TOO FAR INTO THE ELECTION

00:04:25.098 --> 00:04:27.199
CYCLE.
SO SMITH IS UNDER PRESSURE TO

00:04:27.199 --> 00:04:31.070
MOVE THIS ALONG AND MAEZ MAKE
THESE DECISIONS AS SOON AS

00:04:31.070 --> 00:04:31.671
POSSIBLE.

